==History==
2020
*The Royal Delivery was made available before its general release on 2/3/2020 via the [[Trophies|Trophy Road]]. It was also available in a [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Special Challenge]] as a reward.
*From 25/3/2020 through 27/3/2020, the [[Shop]] had a special offer where [[Arenas|Arena]] 12+ players could buy up to 2 special Fortune [[Chests]] for 500 [[Gems]] that guarantee at least 50% of the Chest's contents to be Royal Delivery. The Chest was able to generate up to 110% of its contents to be Royal Delivery.
*The Royal Delivery [[Cards|card]] was generally released on on 6/4/2020.
*On 7/4/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/4/2020)|Balance Update]], added the Royal Delivery as a Trophy Road reward.
*On 5/5/2020, a [[Version History#Season 11 Balance Changes (5/5/2020)|Balance Update]], increased the Royal Delivery's damage by 27%.
*On 1/6/2020, a [[Version History#Season 12 Balance Changes|Balance Update]], decreased the Royal Delivery's damage by 10%.
*On 4/8/2020, a [[Version History#Season 14 Balance Changes (4/8/2020)|Balance Update]], increased the [[Royal Recruits|Royal Recruit]]'s damage by 8%, and removed the Royal Delivery's knockback. Its description was also updated to reflect this, previously saying "''No need to sign for this package! Dropped from the sky, it damages and knocks back enemy Troops before delivering a Royal Recruit. The empty box is also handy for espionage.''"
*On 31/8/2020, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20II%20Update%20(31/8/2020)|Clan Wars II Update]], added the Royal Recruit's statistics on the Royal Delivery's card info screen. It also changed the visual effects of the Royal Delivery's [[Star Points|Star Level]].
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Royal Delivery from Spooky Town to Legendary Arena.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Royal Delivery from Legendary Arena to Serenity Peak.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2024
*On 14/5/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (14/5/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Royal Recruit’s hitpoints by 3%.
2026

* On 4/8/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Royal Delivery's landing damage by 12%

